#: ../developer/openinfra.md:1
msgid "OpenInfra"
msgstr "OpenInfra"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md:3
msgid ""
"OpenInfra publishes the live state of the GPU hosts and inference engines"
" a deployment runs itself, on a public console page, `/openinfra`. It "
"shows each GPU's utilization, memory, power, temperature and "
"interconnect; each host's CPU and memory; and each SGLang or vLLM "
"engine's queue, KV cache, prefix-cache hits, token throughput and "
"latencies, sampled every second. History runs from fifteen minutes to "
"seven days. The page also shows requests and tokens served in the last "
"hour and day, and the shape and latency of recent requests, without "
"prompts, completions, addresses or request ids."
msgstr ""
"OpenInfra 在一个公开的控制台页面 `/openinfra` 上，发布部署自己运行的 GPU 主机和推理引擎的实时状态：每块 GPU "
"的利用率、显存、功耗、温度和互连；每台主机的 CPU 和内存；以及每个 SGLang 或 vLLM 引擎的队列、KV "
"缓存、前缀缓存命中、token 吞吐量和延迟，每秒采样一次。历史数据覆盖十五分钟到七天。页面还会显示最近一小时和一天内处理的请求与 "
"token，以及最近请求的形态和延迟，但不包含提示词、补全内容、地址或请求 id。"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md:12
msgid ""
"It is off unless a deployment turns it on, in two separate steps: "
"collecting and publishing."
msgstr "除非部署主动开启，它默认关闭，开启分两个独立的步骤：采集和发布。"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md:15
msgid "How the data gets there"
msgstr "数据如何到达"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md:17
msgid ""
"A small reporter runs on each GPU host, apart from the gateway. It reads "
"the GPUs, the host and the engines locally, and every second posts one "
"JSON snapshot to the gateway over HTTPS. The gateway stores the snapshots"
" in its own PostgreSQL database, and the page reads them back."
msgstr ""
"每台 GPU 主机上运行一个小型 reporter，与网关分开。它在本机读取 GPU、主机和引擎的数据，每秒通过 HTTPS 向网关发送一份 "
"JSON 快照。网关把快照存入它自己的 PostgreSQL 数据库，页面再从中读取。"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md:29
msgid ""
"**Only outbound HTTPS from the GPU hosts.** The gateway never connects to"
" a host, so nothing on it needs to be reachable."
msgstr "**GPU 主机只需要出站 HTTPS**。网关从不主动连接主机，所以主机上的任何东西都不需要可被访问。"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md:31
msgid ""
"**Any address that reaches the gateway works.** It can be the public "
"site, or the backend's address on a private network. The gateway serves "
"the ingest route itself; the console only relays it (see [The Public Path"
" Table](public-path-table.md))."
msgstr ""
"**任何能到达网关的地址都可以**。可以是公开站点，也可以是后端在私有网络上的地址。采集路由由网关自己提供；控制台只是转发它（参见 [公开路径表"
"](public-path-table.md)）。"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md:35
msgid ""
"**Any gateway replica can take a snapshot.** Replicas share the database,"
" and each scheduled job (rollups and retention, archives) runs on one "
"replica at a time."
msgstr "**任何一个网关副本都能接收快照**。副本共享同一个数据库，每个定时任务（汇总与保留期清理、归档）一次只在一个副本上运行。"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md:38
msgid ""
"**The routing engine does not read these metrics.** They feed the page "
"only."
msgstr "**路由引擎不读取这些指标**。它们只供页面使用。"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md:40
msgid "Turning it on"
msgstr "开启"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md:42
msgid ""
"**Collecting.** Set `OPENINFRA_INGEST_TOKEN` (Admin, Settings, Site & "
"Setup, Integrations) to a long random string, for example the output of "
"`openssl rand -hex 32`. While it is empty, `POST "
"/internal/openinfra/ingest` answers `404` and nothing is collected."
msgstr ""
"**采集**。把 `OPENINFRA_INGEST_TOKEN`（Admin、Settings、Site & "
"Setup、Integrations）设为一个较长的随机字符串，例如 `openssl rand -hex 32` 的输出。它为空时，`POST "
"/internal/openinfra/ingest` 返回 `404`，不采集任何数据。"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md:46
msgid ""
"**Publishing.** Add `\"openinfra\": true` to `features` in the "
"`SITE_CONFIGURATION` document. The console then serves `/openinfra` and "
"links it from the header and footer, and `GET /public-openinfra` and its "
"history answer. Without the flag both answer `404`, even while reporters "
"post, so a deployment can collect before it publishes."
msgstr ""
"**发布**。在 `SITE_CONFIGURATION` 文档的 `features` 中加入 `\"openinfra\": "
"true`。之后控制台会提供 `/openinfra`，并在页眉和页脚中链接到它，`GET /public-openinfra` "
"及其历史接口也会开始应答。没有这个开关时，即使 reporter 正在上报，两者都返回 `404`，因此部署可以先采集、后发布。"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md:51
msgid ""
"**Optional settings**, all Integrations settings and all applied within "
"seconds:"
msgstr "**可选设置**，都属于 Integrations 设置，都会在几秒内生效："

#: ../developer/openinfra.md:53
msgid ""
"`OPENINFRA_ENGINE_ORDER`: engine names, comma-separated, in the order the"
" page shows their tabs. Engines not listed follow, alphabetically."
msgstr "`OPENINFRA_ENGINE_ORDER`：引擎名称，以逗号分隔，即页面显示其标签页的顺序。未列出的引擎按字母顺序排在后面。"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md:55
msgid ""
"`OPENINFRA_RETIRED_ENGINES`: engine ids, comma-separated, left out of the"
" page, the served totals, the history and exports. What they reported "
"stays stored, so removing an id brings it back. Retire an engine by its "
"id rather than relying on one engine replacing another: one endpoint may "
"serve several models, and the same localhost endpoint repeats across "
"hosts."
msgstr ""
"`OPENINFRA_RETIRED_ENGINES`：引擎 "
"id，以逗号分隔，这些引擎不出现在页面、服务总量、历史和导出中。它们上报过的数据仍然保存，所以删掉某个 id 就会让它重新出现。请按 id "
"停用引擎，而不要指望某个引擎会取代另一个：一个端点可能服务多个模型，而相同的 localhost 端点会在不同主机上重复出现。"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md:60
msgid ""
"`OPENINFRA_RETENTION_DAYS`: how many days the per-second samples and "
"request events stay in the database once their week is archived; 7 by "
"default. `OPENINFRA_DELETE_UNARCHIVED` deletes them past it even without "
"an archive. See [Retention and weekly archives](#retention-and-weekly-"
"archives)."
msgstr ""
"`OPENINFRA_RETENTION_DAYS`：每秒样本和请求事件在其所在的周归档之后，在数据库中保留的天数；默认为 "
"7。`OPENINFRA_DELETE_UNARCHIVED` 会在没有归档时也删除超过保留期的数据。参见 [保留期与每周归档"
"](#retention-and-weekly-archives)。"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md:66
msgid "Running a reporter on a GPU host"
msgstr "在 GPU 主机上运行 reporter"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md:68
msgid ""
"The reporter is `ops/openinfra/reporter.py`. It uses only the Python "
"standard library, so the host's system Python runs it, and it needs "
"`nvidia-smi`. Copy `ops/openinfra/` to the host and write a node "
"configuration, starting from `ops/openinfra/node.example.json`:"
msgstr ""
"reporter 是 `ops/openinfra/reporter.py`。它只使用 Python 标准库，因此主机自带的系统 Python "
"就能运行它，另外它需要 `nvidia-smi`。把 `ops/openinfra/` 复制到主机上，并从 "
"`ops/openinfra/node.example.json` 开始编写节点配置："

#: ../developer/openinfra.md
msgid "Field"
msgstr "字段"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "含义"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md
msgid "`node_id`"
msgstr "`node_id`"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md
msgid "The host's id. GPU ids are `<node_id>:<index>`, so each host needs its own"
msgstr "主机的 id。GPU 的 id 是 `<node_id>:<index>`，所以每台主机都需要自己的 id"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md
msgid "`hostname`, `region`, `cluster`"
msgstr "`hostname`, `region`, `cluster`"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md
msgid "Shown on the page"
msgstr "显示在页面上"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md
msgid "`flush_interval`"
msgstr "`flush_interval`"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md
msgid ""
"Seconds between snapshots; 1 by default. The gateway keeps one sample a "
"second, so a shorter interval adds nothing"
msgstr "两次快照之间的秒数；默认为 1。网关每秒只保留一个样本，所以更短的间隔没有意义"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md
msgid "`log_interval`"
msgstr "`log_interval`"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md
msgid ""
"Seconds between the flushes the reporter logs; 60 by default, 0 logs "
"every one"
msgstr "reporter 两次记录上报日志之间的秒数；默认为 60，0 表示每次都记录"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md
msgid "`sglang`"
msgstr "`sglang`"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md
msgid ""
"The engines on the host, SGLang and vLLM alike. An empty list says the "
"host has none"
msgstr "主机上的引擎，SGLang 和 vLLM 都在这里。空列表表示主机上没有引擎"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md
msgid "`sglang[].url`"
msgstr "`sglang[].url`"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md
msgid ""
"Where to scrape the engine: SGLang's `/v1/loads` (preferred) or "
"`/metrics`, vLLM's `/metrics`"
msgstr "从哪里抓取该引擎：SGLang 的 `/v1/loads`（推荐）或 `/metrics`，vLLM 的 `/metrics`"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md
msgid "`sglang[].id`"
msgstr "`sglang[].id`"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md
msgid "The engine's id, unique across the fleet"
msgstr "引擎的 id，在整个集群中唯一"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md
msgid "`sglang[].name`"
msgstr "`sglang[].name`"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md
msgid "Its tab on the page"
msgstr "它在页面上的标签页"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md
msgid "`sglang[].engine`"
msgstr "`sglang[].engine`"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md
msgid "`sglang` or `vllm`"
msgstr "`sglang` 或 `vllm`"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md
msgid "`sglang[].endpoint`"
msgstr "`sglang[].endpoint`"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md
msgid "The address shown for it"
msgstr "为它显示的地址"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md
msgid "`sglang[].gpu_indexes`"
msgstr "`sglang[].gpu_indexes`"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md
msgid "The GPUs it runs on; its tab shows only those"
msgstr "它运行所在的 GPU；它的标签页只显示这些 GPU"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md:87
msgid "Try one snapshot before installing the service:"
msgstr "安装服务之前，先试发一次快照："

#: ../developer/openinfra.md:94
msgid ""
"`ops/openinfra/openinfra-reporter.service` runs it under systemd, reading"
" `OPENINFRA_URL`, `OPENINFRA_TOKEN` and `OPENINFRA_NODE_CONFIG` from "
"`/etc/openinfra/reporter.env` (template: "
"`ops/openinfra/reporter.env.example`). The unit's header lists the "
"install commands. Keep the env file readable by root and the reporter's "
"group only: it holds the token."
msgstr ""
"`ops/openinfra/openinfra-reporter.service` 让它在 systemd 下运行，从 "
"`/etc/openinfra/reporter.env`（模板：`ops/openinfra/reporter.env.example`）读取 "
"`OPENINFRA_URL`、`OPENINFRA_TOKEN` 和 `OPENINFRA_NODE_CONFIG`。该 unit "
"文件的开头列出了安装命令。环境文件只允许 root 和 reporter 所在的组读取：它保存着令牌。"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md:100
msgid "Engine details:"
msgstr "引擎细节："

#: ../developer/openinfra.md:102
msgid ""
"**SGLang.** Start it with `--enable-metrics`. The reporter reads "
"`/v1/loads` and the sibling `/metrics` for the request and token counters"
" that give requests per minute, time to first token and time per output "
"token on every flush. Without them, those come from the engine's "
"container logs, read once a minute and held in between, which needs "
"`docker` (the docker group, or `sudo -n docker`). An engine whose "
"`/v1/loads` needs its API key, which the reporter does not send, is "
"scraped through `/metrics`."
msgstr ""
"**SGLang**。启动时加上 `--enable-metrics`。reporter 读取 `/v1/loads` 以及同级的 "
"`/metrics`，从中得到请求和 token 计数器，每次上报都能据此算出每分钟请求数、首 token 时间和每个输出 token "
"的时间。没有这些计数器时，这些值来自引擎的容器日志，每分钟读取一次，期间保持不变，这需要 `docker`（docker 组，或 `sudo -n"
" docker`）。如果某个引擎的 `/v1/loads` 需要它的 API 密钥（reporter 不会发送），就通过 `/metrics` "
"抓取。"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md:109
msgid ""
"**vLLM.** It has no `/v1/loads`: scrape `/metrics` and set `\"engine\": "
"\"vllm\"`."
msgstr "**vLLM**。它没有 `/v1/loads`：抓取 `/metrics`，并设置 `\"engine\": \"vllm\"`。"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md:111
msgid ""
"**DCGM (optional).** Tensor-core, DRAM, NVLink and PCIe charts need "
"NVIDIA's dcgm-exporter. Install it with the field list and override in "
"`ops/openinfra/dcgm/`; the reporter reads `http://127.0.0.1:9400/metrics`"
" when it answers, and reports everything else without it. A host without "
"DCGM gets its PCIe throughput from an `nvidia-smi dmon` the reporter "
"keeps running beside it."
msgstr ""
"**DCGM（可选）**。Tensor Core、DRAM、NVLink 和 PCIe 图表需要 NVIDIA 的 dcgm-exporter。用"
" `ops/openinfra/dcgm/` 中的字段列表和覆盖配置安装它；它可用时 reporter 会读取 "
"`http://127.0.0.1:9400/metrics`，没有它时其余数据照常上报。没有 DCGM 的主机从 reporter "
"在旁边持续运行的 `nvidia-smi dmon` 获取 PCIe 吞吐量。"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md:118
msgid ""
"The reporter posts once per flush, all engines and GPUs together. It "
"takes each snapshot in the middle of its second of wall-clock time and "
"sends the time it took it, so network delay cannot put two snapshots in "
"the same second; a snapshot that takes longer than the interval skips the"
" next one rather than queueing it. When the gateway cannot be reached it "
"sends the next snapshot on schedule; the snapshots in between are not "
"kept. A failure that repeats is logged once per `log_interval`, with a "
"count of the ones held back. A User-Agent some edges let through is sent;"
" `OPENINFRA_USER_AGENT` overrides it."
msgstr ""
"reporter 每次上报发送一个请求，所有引擎和 GPU "
"一起发送。它在每一秒挂钟时间的中间采集快照，并发送采集时间，因此网络延迟不会让两份快照落入同一秒；耗时超过间隔的快照会跳过下一次，而不是排队补发。无法连接网关时，它按计划发送下一份快照；中间的快照不会保留。反复出现的失败每个"
" `log_interval` 只记录一次，并附上期间被省略的次数。它发送一个某些边缘层会放行的 User-"
"Agent；`OPENINFRA_USER_AGENT` 可以覆盖它。"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md:127
msgid ""
"Command-line flags can stand in for a configuration file: `--dashboard` "
"(the gateway address), `--token`, `--node-id`, `--hostname`, `--region`, "
"`--cluster`, `--flush-interval`, `--log-interval` and a repeated "
"`--sglang-url`."
msgstr ""
"命令行参数可以代替配置文件：`--dashboard`（网关地址）、`--token`、`--node-"
"id`、`--hostname`、`--region`、`--cluster`、`--flush-interval`、`--log-"
"interval`，以及可重复使用的 `--sglang-url`。"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md:132
msgid "The ingest API"
msgstr "采集 API"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md:134
msgid ""
"`POST /internal/openinfra/ingest` takes one host's snapshot, with "
"`Authorization: Bearer <token>` (or `x-ingest-token: <token>`) carrying "
"`OPENINFRA_INGEST_TOKEN`:"
msgstr ""
"`POST /internal/openinfra/ingest` 接收一台主机的快照，用 `Authorization: Bearer "
"<token>`（或 `x-ingest-token: <token>`）携带 `OPENINFRA_INGEST_TOKEN`："

#: ../developer/openinfra.md:163
msgid ""
"`ts` is when the reporter took the snapshot, in milliseconds by its own "
"clock. While that is within a minute of the gateway's clock the "
"snapshot's samples are stored at it, and otherwise at the gateway's time."
" It may be left out. Whether a host is online is always the gateway's "
"clock alone."
msgstr ""
"`ts` 是 reporter "
"采集快照的时间，以它自己的时钟计，单位为毫秒。只要它与网关的时钟相差不超过一分钟，快照的样本就按这个时间存储，否则按网关的时间。可以省略。主机是否在线始终只看网关的时钟。"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md:167
msgid ""
"`sglang` holds every engine on the host, vLLM included (`engine` says "
"which), and may also be a single object. An engine sends parsed "
"`metrics`, its raw `prometheus` text, or both; text that exposes several "
"models gives each model its own engine row, `<id>:<model>`, and lists the"
" server's request events under each."
msgstr ""
"`sglang` 包含主机上的每个引擎，包括 vLLM（`engine` 说明是哪一种），也可以是单个对象。引擎可以发送解析后的 "
"`metrics`、原始的 `prometheus` 文本，或两者都发送；暴露了多个模型的文本会为每个模型生成单独的引擎行，即 "
"`<id>:<model>`，该服务器的请求事件会列在其中每一行下。"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md:172
msgid ""
"Parsing is lenient, so reporters of any age keep working: a number may "
"arrive as a numeric string, unknown fields are ignored, and a value of "
"the wrong type is dropped. A body of the wrong shape is refused whole."
msgstr ""
"解析是宽松的，因此任何版本的 reporter "
"都能继续工作：数字可以以数字字符串的形式到达，未知字段会被忽略，类型不对的值会被丢弃。形状不对的请求体会被整体拒绝。"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md:175
msgid ""
"A body carries at most 64 GPUs and 16 engines, keeps 20 request events "
"per engine, and is limited to 2 MiB. A request event more than 15 minutes"
" older, or more than a minute newer, than the snapshot is dropped, both "
"by the reporter's clock, and counted in the answer's `requests_dropped`. "
"While the reporter's clock is off, its request events move with its "
"samples onto the gateway's time."
msgstr ""
"一个请求体最多包含 64 块 GPU 和 16 个引擎，每个引擎保留 20 条请求事件，大小限制为 2 MiB。按 reporter "
"的时钟计，比快照早 15 分钟以上、或晚一分钟以上的请求事件会被丢弃，并计入应答中的 `requests_dropped`。reporter "
"的时钟有偏差时，它的请求事件会和样本一起移到网关的时间上。"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md
msgid "Answer"
msgstr "应答"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md
msgid "When"
msgstr "何时"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`200 {\"ok\": true, \"gpus\": N, \"sglang\": M}`"
msgstr "`200 {\"ok\": true, \"gpus\": N, \"sglang\": M}`"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md
msgid "Committed, with `\"requests_dropped\": K` when request events were dropped"
msgstr "已提交；有请求事件被丢弃时附带 `\"requests_dropped\": K`"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md
msgid "`400`"
msgstr "`400`"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md
msgid "The body is not JSON, or not a snapshot; the message says why"
msgstr "请求体不是 JSON，或者不是快照；消息会说明原因"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md
msgid "`401`"
msgstr "`401`"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md
msgid "The token is missing or wrong. Checked before the body is read"
msgstr "令牌缺失或错误。在读取请求体之前检查"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md
msgid "`404`"
msgstr "`404`"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md
msgid "No token is configured: this deployment does not collect"
msgstr "没有配置令牌：此部署不采集"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md
msgid "`408`, `413`"
msgstr "`408`, `413`"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md
msgid "The body was too slow or too large"
msgstr "请求体太慢或太大"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md
msgid "`503`"
msgstr "`503`"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md
msgid "No database, or the write failed; the next snapshot comes as usual"
msgstr "没有数据库，或写入失败；下一份快照照常到来"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md:191
msgid "What the page reads"
msgstr "页面读取什么"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md:193
msgid ""
"Both reads are unauthenticated, serve only what the page shows, and "
"answer `404` unless the deployment publishes OpenInfra."
msgstr "两个读取接口都不需要认证，只提供页面显示的内容，并且除非部署发布了 OpenInfra，否则返回 `404`。"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md:196
msgid ""
"`GET /public-openinfra`: the fleet's state (`healthy`, `busy`, `degraded`"
" or `offline`), fleet-wide figures, every host, GPU and engine (under "
"`sglang`, in tab order), the requests and tokens served in the last hour "
"and day, and each engine's 40 most recent requests."
msgstr ""
"`GET /public-openinfra`：集群状态（`healthy`、`busy`、`degraded` 或 "
"`offline`）、集群总体数据、每台主机、每块 GPU 和每个引擎（在 `sglang` 下，按标签页顺序）、最近一小时和一天处理的请求与 "
"token，以及每个引擎最近的 40 个请求。"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md:200
msgid ""
"`GET /public-openinfra/history?hours=2&node=`: time series for every "
"host, or one, over the last `hours`, rounded up to one of 0.25, 0.5, 1, "
"2, 3, 6, 12, 24, 48, 72 and 168. A `node` that has never reported answers"
" `404`. Each point is the mean of the per-second samples in it, and "
"`grain_ms` says how far apart the points are:"
msgstr ""
"`GET /public-openinfra/history?hours=2&node=`：所有主机或某一台主机在最近 `hours` "
"小时内的时间序列，向上取整为 0.25、0.5、1、2、3、6、12、24、48、72 或 168 之一。从未上报过的 `node` 返回 "
"`404`。每个数据点是其中每秒样本的平均值，`grain_ms` 说明数据点之间的间隔："

#: ../developer/openinfra.md
msgid "Window"
msgstr "窗口"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md
msgid "Points"
msgstr "数据点"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md
msgid "15 minutes"
msgstr "15 分钟"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md
msgid "5 seconds apart"
msgstr "间隔 5 秒"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md
msgid "30 minutes"
msgstr "30 分钟"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md
msgid "10 seconds apart"
msgstr "间隔 10 秒"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md
msgid "1 hour"
msgstr "1 小时"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md
msgid "20 seconds apart"
msgstr "间隔 20 秒"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md
msgid "2 and 3 hours"
msgstr "2 和 3 小时"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md
msgid "a minute apart"
msgstr "间隔一分钟"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md
msgid "6 to 24 hours"
msgstr "6 到 24 小时"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md
msgid "20 minutes apart"
msgstr "间隔 20 分钟"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md
msgid "2 to 7 days"
msgstr "2 到 7 天"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md
msgid "an hour apart"
msgstr "间隔一小时"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md:215
msgid ""
"The page offers 15 minutes, 2 hours, 24 hours and 7 days, and refreshes "
"every 5 seconds over 15 minutes and every 30 seconds otherwise."
msgstr "页面提供 15 分钟、2 小时、24 小时和 7 天四个范围，15 分钟范围每 5 秒刷新一次，其余每 30 秒刷新一次。"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md:218
msgid ""
"Each answer is computed at most once every 5 seconds (the dashboard) or, "
"for a history window, once per spacing of its points up to 30 seconds, "
"however many people ask, and carries a matching `Cache-Control`."
msgstr ""
"每个应答最多每 5 秒（仪表板）计算一次，历史窗口则按其数据点间隔最多计算一次（最长 30 秒），无论有多少人请求，并带有相应的 `Cache-"
"Control`。"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md:222
msgid ""
"An administrator can download the data: `GET "
"/admin/openinfra/export?days=30` (1 to 30 days) returns the identities, "
"the served totals and the history as a JSON attachment, published or not."
msgstr ""
"管理员可以下载这些数据：`GET /admin/openinfra/export?days=30`（1 到 30 天）以 JSON "
"附件的形式返回各项标识、服务总量和历史，无论是否已发布。"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md:226
msgid "Storage"
msgstr "存储"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md:228
msgid ""
"The snapshots are kept in the `openinfra_*` tables (revisions "
"`0026_openinfra` and `0027_openinfra_archives`):"
msgstr "快照保存在 `openinfra_*` 表中（修订版本 `0026_openinfra` 和 `0027_openinfra_archives`）："

#: ../developer/openinfra.md:231
msgid ""
"**Live rows**, one per host, GPU and engine, overwritten by every "
"snapshot. A snapshot marks a GPU degraded at 85 °C or with ECC errors, "
"and an engine with more than 2000 queued requests or its GPUs at 95 %. "
"Anything silent for 90 seconds reads as offline."
msgstr ""
"**实时行**，每台主机、每块 GPU、每个引擎一行，每份快照都会覆盖它们。快照会把达到 85 °C 或出现 ECC 错误的 GPU "
"标为降级，也会把排队请求超过 2000 个、或其 GPU 达到 95% 的引擎标为降级。静默 90 秒的任何对象都显示为离线。"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md:235
msgid ""
"**Samples**, at most one per host, GPU and engine each second: the first "
"snapshot in each second is kept. The served totals add up each sample's "
"rates over that spacing. Samples from a release that kept one every 6 "
"seconds stay, each moved to its own second."
msgstr ""
"**样本**，每台主机、每块 GPU、每个引擎每秒最多一个：保留每一秒中的第一份快照。服务总量按这个间隔累加每个样本的速率。之前每 6 "
"秒保留一个样本的版本所存的样本会保留下来，各自移到它所在的那一秒。"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md:239
msgid ""
"**Rollups** for 20-minute and hourly buckets, refreshed by the gateway's "
"scheduler one minute past every fifth minute, on one replica at a time. A"
" rollup keeps the means of its bucket's samples and the sums the served "
"totals need."
msgstr ""
"**汇总**，按 20 "
"分钟和每小时的时间桶，由网关的调度器在每个第五分钟过后一分钟刷新，每次只在一个副本上运行。汇总保留其时间桶内样本的平均值，以及服务总量需要的累加值。"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md:243
msgid ""
"**Request events**, as the reporter reads them from the engine logs, each"
" stored once however often it is sent."
msgstr "**请求事件**，即 reporter 从引擎日志中读到的内容，无论发送多少次都只保存一次。"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md:246
msgid ""
"A sample row takes roughly 200 bytes for a GPU and 400 for an engine, "
"index included, and each one gets 86,400 a day: a host with eight GPUs "
"and two engines adds about 200 MB a day, 1.5 GB in the week the database "
"keeps. Rollups add a few megabytes a year per host and are kept."
msgstr ""
"一个样本行大约占 200 字节（GPU）或 400 字节（引擎），包含索引，而每个对象每天产生 86,400 行：一台有八块 GPU "
"和两个引擎的主机每天大约增加 200 MB，数据库保留的一周约 1.5 GB。汇总每台主机每年只增加几 MB，并会一直保留。"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md:251
msgid "Retention and weekly archives"
msgstr "保留期与每周归档"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md:253
msgid ""
"Samples and request events older than `OPENINFRA_RETENTION_DAYS` (7 by "
"default) are deleted by the maintenance job that refreshes the rollups, a"
" few minutes' worth at a time; 0 keeps everything. Live rows and rollups "
"are kept, so the 24-hour and 7-day views reach back past the retention."
msgstr ""
"早于 `OPENINFRA_RETENTION_DAYS`（默认 7 天）的样本和请求事件由刷新汇总的维护任务删除，每次删除几分钟的数据；0 "
"表示全部保留。实时行和汇总会一直保留，因此 24 小时和 7 天视图可以看到保留期之前的数据。"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md:258
msgid ""
"Before they go, each week is archived to `OPENINFRA_ARCHIVE_DIR`, a "
"directory on the gateway's own filesystem and so an environment setting, "
"not one under Admin. A job of its own, seven minutes past every hour, "
"writes each week once it has ended (Monday 00:00 UTC) and an hour has "
"passed, to a directory named for its Monday:"
msgstr ""
"在删除之前，每一周都会归档到 `OPENINFRA_ARCHIVE_DIR`。它是网关自己文件系统上的目录，因此是一个环境设置，而不是 Admin"
" 中的设置。一个独立的任务在每小时第七分钟运行，在一周结束（周一 00:00 UTC）并再过一小时后，把这一周写入一个以该周周一命名的目录："

#: ../developer/openinfra.md:276
msgid ""
"**Nothing is deleted before it is archived.** While "
"`OPENINFRA_ARCHIVE_DIR` is set, only weeks already archived are deleted, "
"so a week stays in the database until it is on disk, however long the "
"directory cannot be written. Without it nothing is deleted, unless "
"`OPENINFRA_DELETE_UNARCHIVED` (an Integrations setting, off by default) "
"is on: then rows past the retention are deleted unarchived."
msgstr ""
"**归档之前不会删除任何数据**。设置了 `OPENINFRA_ARCHIVE_DIR` "
"时，只删除已经归档的周，所以一周的数据会一直留在数据库中，直到它写入磁盘，无论该目录有多久无法写入。没有设置时什么都不删除，除非开启了 "
"`OPENINFRA_DELETE_UNARCHIVED`（一个 Integrations "
"设置，默认关闭）：此时超过保留期的行会在不归档的情况下删除。"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md:282
msgid ""
"**A week's directory is whole or absent.** It is written to a hidden "
"directory beside it and renamed into place once complete, then recorded "
"in `openinfra_archives` with the host that wrote it. A week with nothing "
"in it is skipped. Each table is read a host, GPU or engine at a time, in "
"short transactions, so a long archive holds back neither vacuum nor the "
"rollups."
msgstr ""
"**一周的目录要么完整，要么不存在**。它先写入旁边的一个隐藏目录，完成后再重命名到位，然后连同写入它的主机一起记录到 "
"`openinfra_archives` 中。没有任何数据的周会被跳过。每张表按主机、GPU "
"或引擎逐个在短事务中读取，因此耗时较长的归档既不会拖住 vacuum，也不会拖住汇总。"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md:287
msgid ""
"**Docker Compose** sets it to `/app/var/data/openinfra-archive`, which is"
" `var/data/openinfra-archive` in the deployment's checkout, outside the "
"container. Set it to an empty value in the overlay to turn archiving off."
" A week of a host with eight GPUs and two engines compresses to roughly "
"200 MB; move old weeks elsewhere as you would any backup."
msgstr ""
"**Docker Compose** 把它设为 `/app/var/data/openinfra-archive`，即部署检出目录中的 "
"`var/data/openinfra-archive`，位于容器之外。在 overlay 中把它设为空值即可关闭归档。一台有八块 GPU "
"和两个引擎的主机，一周的数据压缩后约 200 MB；像对待任何备份一样，把旧的周移到别处。"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md:292
msgid ""
"**More than one replica**: the job runs on whichever replica holds its "
"lock, so point the setting at storage every replica shares, or run one "
"gateway."
msgstr "**多个副本**：任务在持有其锁的副本上运行，所以请把该设置指向所有副本共享的存储，或者只运行一个网关。"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md:295
msgid ""
"`python -m serving.openinfra.archive` lists the weeks archived so far; "
"with `--run` it refreshes the rollups, archives and deletes once, as the "
"jobs do. Run it where the gateway runs, with its `DB_*` settings and "
"`OPENINFRA_ARCHIVE_DIR`."
msgstr ""
"`python -m serving.openinfra.archive` 列出已经归档的周；加上 `--run` "
"则像定时任务一样刷新汇总、归档并删除一次。请在网关运行的地方运行它，并带上网关的 `DB_*` 设置和 "
"`OPENINFRA_ARCHIVE_DIR`。"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md:299
msgid ""
"The files are plain CSV: times are milliseconds since the Unix epoch, and"
" a sample's `bucket` is its `ts` divided by 1000. To look at a week "
"again, read the files directly, or load one into a table of the same "
"shape:"
msgstr ""
"这些文件是普通的 CSV：时间是 Unix 纪元以来的毫秒数，样本的 `bucket` 是其 `ts` 除以 "
"1000。要重新查看某一周，可以直接读取文件，或把它加载到结构相同的表中："

#: ../developer/openinfra.md:307
msgid "Moving from the Cloudflare Worker"
msgstr "从 Cloudflare Worker 迁移"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md:309
msgid ""
"OpenInfra was a Cloudflare Worker with its own D1 database before it "
"moved into the gateway. The snapshot format is the same; only the address"
" changes."
msgstr "在迁入网关之前，OpenInfra 是一个使用自己 D1 数据库的 Cloudflare Worker。快照格式不变；只有地址改变。"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md:312
msgid ""
"Deploy a gateway release that has OpenInfra and set "
"`OPENINFRA_INGEST_TOKEN`. Reusing the Worker's `INGEST_TOKEN` means the "
"hosts need only the new address."
msgstr ""
"部署包含 OpenInfra 的网关版本，并设置 `OPENINFRA_INGEST_TOKEN`。沿用 Worker 的 "
"`INGEST_TOKEN`，主机就只需要换成新地址。"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md:315
msgid ""
"On each host, replace the reporter with `ops/openinfra/reporter.py` (it "
"posts to `/internal/openinfra/ingest`, not `/api/ingest`) and point "
"`OPENINFRA_URL` at the gateway. Check that snapshots arrive with `GET "
"/admin/openinfra/export?days=1` before publishing."
msgstr ""
"在每台主机上，把 reporter 换成 `ops/openinfra/reporter.py`（它发送到 "
"`/internal/openinfra/ingest`，而不是 `/api/ingest`），并把 `OPENINFRA_URL` "
"指向网关。发布之前，用 `GET /admin/openinfra/export?days=1` 确认快照已经到达。"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md:319
msgid ""
"Export the D1 database and import it, from an environment with the "
"gateway's `DB_*` settings, such as the backend container:"
msgstr "在带有网关 `DB_*` 设置的环境中（例如后端容器）导出 D1 数据库并导入："

#: ../developer/openinfra.md:328
msgid ""
"What the gateway already holds wins: a host, GPU or engine row or a "
"rollup bucket it has is kept, and samples and request events are imported"
" only from before each host's, GPU's or engine's first one in the "
"gateway, and never into a week already archived; it holds the archive "
"job's lock while it runs. The import can therefore run after the switch, "
"and again. Imported samples older than the retention are archived and "
"deleted by the jobs' next runs."
msgstr ""
"网关中已有的数据优先：它已有的主机、GPU 或引擎行以及汇总时间桶都会保留，样本和请求事件只导入每台主机、每块 GPU "
"或每个引擎在网关中第一条之前的部分，并且从不导入已经归档的周；导入运行期间会持有归档任务的锁。因此导入可以在切换之后运行，也可以再次运行。导入的样本中早于保留期的部分，会由任务接下来的几次运行归档并删除。"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md:335
msgid "List the engines the Worker had retired in `OPENINFRA_RETIRED_ENGINES`."
msgstr "把 Worker 中已停用的引擎列入 `OPENINFRA_RETIRED_ENGINES`。"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md:336
msgid ""
"Turn on `features.openinfra`, send the old dashboard's address to "
"`/openinfra`, and retire the Worker."
msgstr "开启 `features.openinfra`，把旧仪表板的地址指向 `/openinfra`，然后停用 Worker。"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md:339
msgid "Limitations"
msgstr "限制"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md:341
msgid "A reporter keeps nothing while the gateway is unreachable."
msgstr "网关无法访问期间，reporter 不保留任何数据。"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md:342
msgid ""
"The ingest endpoint has no rate limit of its own; the token is the gate, "
"so make it long and random."
msgstr "采集端点没有自己的速率限制；令牌就是门槛，所以请使用较长的随机令牌。"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md:344
msgid ""
"The served totals are estimates: they add up each sample's rates rather "
"than count requests, and the last day is summed from 20-minute rollups, "
"each bucket's mean rate over the part of it inside the day. A bucket in "
"which a reporter started or stopped counts as if it had reported "
"throughout."
msgstr ""
"服务总量是估计值：它们累加每个样本的速率，而不是统计请求数；最近一天由 20 "
"分钟汇总求和，每个时间桶的平均速率只按其落在这一天内的部分计算。reporter 在某个时间桶中途开始或停止时，这个时间桶仍按全程都有上报来计算。"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md:348
msgid ""
"The page's finest points are 5-second means. The per-second samples are "
"in the database for the retention and in the weekly archives."
msgstr "页面上最细的数据点是 5 秒平均值。每秒样本在保留期内保存在数据库中，也保存在每周归档里。"

#: ../developer/openinfra.md:350
msgid ""
"A request event that reaches the gateway more than 15 minutes after it "
"happened is dropped."
msgstr "到达网关时已经发生超过 15 分钟的请求事件会被丢弃。"
